1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,337
I will apply a constant eighteen-amp load for the next hour.

2
00:00:03,337 --> 00:00:06,674
The dashboard publishes a load command to the simulator.

3
00:00:06,674 --> 00:00:16,165
The plant changes its current; new telemetry arrives at one hertz; and the twin recomputes SoC, power loss, temperature, and remaining runtime.

4
00:00:16,165 --> 00:00:21,771
This is the core digital-twin loop: new data changes the digital representation.

